.1,2002,51,90,22],[21700,20.4,2002,55,91,24]],"links":[["Huerfano County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/huerfano-county"],["ARC or PLC in Huerfano County","/arc-plc/colorado/huerfano-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Huerfano County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids, April to May and May to June each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, Feb-Mar was 37% of normal and Oct-Nov was 47%, and 2026 so far has Mar-Apr at 28%. Grid 21100 shows a preliminary July to August 2026 estimate of 60.9.</p>"}
